Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:04:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Tyreese!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-其他人呢  -刚还在我身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's everybody else? - They were just behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a clearing ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有没有地方休整  -我没去那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A place to regroup? - I didn't get very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面可能有座建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be a building up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像在树林中看到塔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I saw a tower past the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tower? What kind of tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.10,0:01:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不知道里面是否安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但外面肯定不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what's out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能带她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在拖累你  在拖累我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's slowing you down, she's slowing us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们进去后  要是她变行尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once we're in there, when she turns...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说的对  你得留下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. You gotta leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.49,0:02:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会把她生吞活剥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll tear her apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不能这么做  -你想带着她到处逃命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't do this. - You wanna drag her around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很痛苦  而当她最后转化...\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's suffering. And when she finally turns--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本还不能失去妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben's not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这绝对是个错误  -也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a mistake. - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应米尔顿会帮他火化科尔曼先生的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised Milton I'd help him cremate Mr. Coleman's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.87,0:04:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's sweet of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要是还不舒服  他可以独自解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you're still rattled, he can handle it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shouldn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你团结起来的这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these people you've brought together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到这来可不仅仅是寻求保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're here for more than just protection;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在互相支撑共度难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're helping each other through this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开始喜欢上伍德伯里了对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woodbury's starting to grow on you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佩妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:18.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸去打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Daddy's gone a-hunting*
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎回小兔皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}*To get a little rabbit skin*
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为宝贝添衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}*To wrap his baby...*
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬  他有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, did he--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没怎么碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He barely touched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么久以来  我们一直逃避行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time, running from walkers--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却忘了活人的丑恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}you forget what people do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一向如此丑恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}have always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看他们对你下的毒手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what they did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:01.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他没有对你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as he didn't--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们得轻装上阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we need to downsize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不可能搜遍每座建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no way we're gonna check in all them buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,守卫太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not with all them guards there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱是绝佳的藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prison's the perfect place to hole up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前关囚犯  现在防行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What once kept prisoners in now keeps biters out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个方法很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算占领那里  把伍德伯里搬过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking of taking it over, moving Woodbury there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家喜欢这里  因为这里和以前的生活一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}People love it here because it feels like what was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们住在牢房里  四周都是铁栅栏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move them to damp cells surrounded by barbed wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把住在监狱的那群人干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take out the group that's living there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让行尸重新涌入那里  没人会知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the biters move back in. No one'll be the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  我弟弟和他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is my brother's with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以和他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他做我们的内线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him our inside man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接应我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get us in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先举白旗示弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll wave the white flag
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像国民警卫队那次一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like we did with the National Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔不能有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happens to Daryl. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦和那个姑娘怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Glenn and the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在这待的时间越长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the longer they're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚发现真相的可能性就越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more chance Andrea will find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们带到恐怖角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them to the Screamer Pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是你被关的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you were held?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里被审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was questioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还会被关在其他什么地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea where else they could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你说过有宵禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said there was a curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白天街上都是人  这些人还没回去而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}The street is packed during the day. Those are stragglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人进来  我们就无处可躲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone comes in here, we're sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能被关在他公寓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could be in his apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  如果不在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What if they ain't?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就去别的地方找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll look somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.67,0:12:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过你能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you could help us. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经尽我所能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where in the hell are they? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这事黄了  我们就丢下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this goes south, we're cutting her loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她在引我们入陷阱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she's leading us into a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:21.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正现在我们毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now it's the blind leading the blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们分开行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.32,0:12:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面看到动静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you moving from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装神弄鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该进这儿的  你自己明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not supposed to be in here and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Get on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绑紧他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip tie him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们扣了我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are holding some of our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们在哪儿  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell are they? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,张嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真会哄小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are good with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有妹妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got little sisters? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你到底多大了  -十七岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old are you, anyway? - 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十七岁  如花少女啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}17. Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能和你聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I speak with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.15,0:13:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.99,0:13:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有什么问题  -离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the problem? - Stay away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来这儿不是为了谈情说爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about you trying to repopulate the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并无冒犯之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被关起来有一阵儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been locked up a long while
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:13:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里连女人的影子都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, well, there weren't many women.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬和格伦是一对  你又是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Maggie, she's with Glenn and you're a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能和她聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just talking with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.27,0:14:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留着  短发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the... short hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a lesbian?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, my,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如花大婶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别打歪主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.27,0:15:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能叙叙旧真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad we could catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来  走  快走  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet, move. Let's go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Aw, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪声从那边传来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shots came from up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去看看  -不  我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna check it out. - No, I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时行尸会突破边防栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes biters get in through the side fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.22,0:16:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need for anyone to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人持枪闯了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys came through with guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, think. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.61,0:16:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六七个人吧  从来没见过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six or seven guys. I've never seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.62,0:16:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们遭袭击了吗  要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we under attack? What should we do? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人请回到屋子里  关好门  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, please just go home, lock your doors, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要确保大家的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to keep everyone safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在马上进屋  把灯关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just get inside, keep your lights off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.27,0:16:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们遭到了袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去地毯式搜索那几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fan out and you find these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要冒险活捉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take any chances, try and take prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格杀勿论  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot to kill, huh? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面无路可走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no way out back here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  你怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, how did you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤有多重\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad are you hurt? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她刚刚就跟在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她被抓住了  要我去找她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she was spotted. Want me to go look for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们得先带他们离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We gotta get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.35,0:17:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她得靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是莫尔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this was Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was. He did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你看到他了  -面对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You saw him? - Face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把行尸推向我  他准备杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threw a walker at me. He was gonna execute us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥就是总督吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-So my brother's this governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  总督另有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥是他的副官什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's his lieutenant or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.87,0:17:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道我和你们在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he know I'm still with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在知道了  瑞克  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does now. Rick, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们告诉他监狱在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We told him where the prison was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们实在挺不住了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't hold out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:17:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  不需要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会继续搜捕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上回去  你能走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get back. Can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的车停在几英里以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a car a few miles out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm good. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果莫尔在这附近  我得去见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if Merle's around, I need to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行  我们还处在敌营\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now. We're in hostile territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他是我哥哥  我不能..  -看他干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's my brother. I ain't-- - Look at what he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们得马上离开这儿 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we gotta-- we gotta get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以找他谈谈  或许可以解决这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can talk to him. Maybe I can work something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不  你现在头脑不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You're not thinking straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别管其他的  他们有伤在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no matter what they say, they're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:26.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦几乎不能走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn can barely walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一被行尸包围\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna make it out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又被总督追上\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we get overrun by walkers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this governor catches up to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-找到他们了吗  -找到谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any sign of them? - Signs of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面究竟什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有群混蛋想抢我们的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some assholes want what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们还在这儿干等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are we doing waiting around here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去干掉这群兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take these sons of bitches out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:53.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定我们的防线被突破了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know that the perimeter was breached?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有谁看见他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone actually see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们杀了沃伦  -沃伦死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They killed Warren. - Killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:19:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,近距离袭击  喉咙被戳穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got up close, stuck a stake through his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要加强巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need patrols now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能给恐怖份子留任何机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take chances with these terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去查看一下居民们  确保他们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You check on our people, make sure they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我是居委会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to do house calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挨家挨户查水表吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure everyone's tucked in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:12.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙可能藏在某户人家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys could be holed up in one of our residences.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能挟持居民当人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could be holding someone captive or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找不到其它人干这活了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't anyone else handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的经验可以用在其他方面...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a hell of a lot of experience and--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家分散搜查吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔负责指挥搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle will lead the search.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不让海莉去挨家挨户查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think Haley should handle the door-to-doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.39,0:19:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一个成年人去安抚人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need someone with some authority to provide reassurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海莉只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这伙人已经杀了一个人  打倒另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people have already killed one man, beaten another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我枪法不错  -就照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm good with a gun-- - Just do as I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我数到三  跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three. Stay tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一  二  三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有多少人  -没看清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - I didn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓  反正会越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't matter. There's gonna be more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要赶紧转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少看见其中一个  黑人  很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them, at least. Black guy, young.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像穿着囚服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked like he was wearing a prison jumpsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越狱的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escaped convicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有手雷吗  -有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any grenades left? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好手雷  我们必须冲到墙那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them ready. We gotta gun into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶紧离开街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get off the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.02,0:22:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不用拼命  安全第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not soldiers, we're survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把风头避过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll wait them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烟雾一散去就能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the smoke clears--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那时他们早跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, they could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get off the street. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-离开街道  快  -妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Off the street. Come on, move! - Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们赶紧走  我来掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys go ahead. I'm gonna lay down some cover fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我们要一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we gotta stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太危险了  我会紧跟在你们身后的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too hairy. I'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走  -我们离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! - Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-安全  走  -继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear! Go!  - Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick! Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.39,0:24:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算把朱迪思哄睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally got Judith to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.33,0:24:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奶粉还有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we with formula?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还能再撑一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have enough to last us another month.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这周末我和卡萝尔再去弄点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Carol for some more at the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.50,0:24:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时你爸爸和其他人就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad and the others will be back by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可说不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.95,0:24:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  朱迪思是我唯一的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, Judith is the only family I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.52,0:24:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是监狱里面传来的  -是卡萝尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was from inside. - Was that Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.54,0:24:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和阿克塞尔去外面哨塔放哨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out keeping watch in the guard tower with Axel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.08,0:24:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一他们有事儿回来了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they came back in for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.43,0:24:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一他们有麻烦了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they're in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.63,0:24:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哨塔看看她是不是在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check the tower, see if she's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么还有人可以进得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could anyone else get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.94,0:24:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坟墓那儿已经行尸密布了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tombs are filled with walkers
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是从外面游荡来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wandered in from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.94,0:24:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许有幸存者也会进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else could have done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.03,0:24:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.40,0:24:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.74,0:24:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换我父亲就会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father would go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.31,0:25:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.41,0:26:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.34,0:26:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.46,0:26:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.36,0:26:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走  快走  -让我背着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Go! Just go. - Let me take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.68,0:26:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.52,0:26:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们不能带上她  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to leave her! - No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.29,0:27:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.72,0:27:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.86,0:28:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.10,0:28:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊  来啊  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.84,0:28:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.88,0:28:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.86,0:28:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是冲我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.94,0:28:59.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要让她承受痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need for her to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.59,0:29:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她什么都感觉不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.72,0:29:05.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.73,0:29:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要伤害我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.04,0:29:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.33,0:31:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  天哪  我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.74,0:31:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.27,0:32:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  堂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Donna?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.29,0:32:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.75,0:32:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.12,0:32:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.69,0:33:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她很快就要变了  -你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She doesn't have that long. - Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.31,0:33:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么进来的  还有别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in here? Who are you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.44,0:33:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们会帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.57,0:33:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先办正事\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  我们自己解决吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we take care of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.24,0:33:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要  泰尔西  -必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Tyreese! - I gotta do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.36,0:33:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  带着本去那边墙上背过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just take Ben and lean against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.62,0:33:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一眨眼的功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.76,0:33:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.44,0:33:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.24,0:33:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  你打算把我们关在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, did you just lock us in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.00,0:33:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.10,0:33:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这屋子很安全  你们不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This room is secure. You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.45,0:33:54.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会给你们食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.14,0:34:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-把门打开  -我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open this door. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.91,0:34:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  小兄弟  我们又不是动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. We're not animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.60,0:34:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.97,0:34:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就这样把我们扔在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just leave us in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.34,0:34:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开门  赶紧给我打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open this door! Open it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.28,0:34:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.23,0:34:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我离门远点  别纠缠他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back away from their door and let the man go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.74,0:34:26.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.85,0:34:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几周以来最好的条件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best we've had it in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.07,0:34:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}His house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.75,0:34:40.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,况且我们还有其他事要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got other things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.15,0:34:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是来找麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.39,0:34:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不应该帮帮他们吗  -我帮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shouldn't we help them? - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.14,0:35:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看上去不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.54,0:35:05.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被玻璃伤的很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glass has done a lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.50,0:35:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-现在不行  -滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not yet. - Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.86,0:35:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让我们单独说句话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give us a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.04,0:35:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.22,0:35:26.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么她会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.80,0:35:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么就跟她打起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you fighting her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.68,0:35:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是回来杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came back to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.47,0:35:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -我还想问你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.41,0:35:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.93,0:35:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些鱼缸  人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fish tanks, the heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.80,0:35:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我逼自己看着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made myself look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.36,0:35:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时刻提示着我外面世界的险恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepared me for the horrors outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.17,0:35:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那佩妮呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.34,0:36:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.17,0:36:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚听说  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.60,0:36:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛  是不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eye, is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.75,0:36:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.45,0:36:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.79,0:36:30.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们翻墙跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made it over the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.86,0:36:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天一早我就去追他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go after them in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.78,0:36:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.85,0:36:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.52,0:37:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转过去  转过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around. Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.60,0:37:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你想要的东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get what you came for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.40,0:37:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人都哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the rest of your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.68,0:37:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥斯卡被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.62,0:37:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔不见了  你看见他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl is missing. You didn't see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.59,0:37:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是他有个三长两短  我就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens to him, I'll--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我帮你们救出了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you here to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.20,0:37:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.00,0:37:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要帮手  不论你想把他俩带回监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need help to get them back to the prison
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.83,0:37:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是回去救达里尔  \N{\fnArial\fs30}or to go back in there for Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.89,0:37:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何  你们都需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.59,0:38:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.55,0:38:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从围墙建好后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't been a night like this
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.09,0:38:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚这样的场面还是头一遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the walls were completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.97,0:38:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本以为噩梦都已过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought we were past it--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.20,0:38:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遥想灾情爆发初期\N{\fnArial\fs30}past the days when we all sat,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.85,0:39:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们围坐在电视机前\N{\fnArial\fs30}huddled, scared in front of the TV
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.84,0:39:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惊恐万分  惶惶不得终日\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the early days of the outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时的恐惧感\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fear we all felt then,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.12,0:39:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚又袭上心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}we felt it again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.25,0:39:20.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你们失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.84,0:39:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾答应保障大家的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.95,0:39:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今瞅瞅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.21,0:39:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.53,0:39:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本该安慰你们说  会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should tell you that we'll be okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.44,0:39:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.27,0:39:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明早把尸体一埋  然后继续生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}that tomorrow we'll bury our dead and endure,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.04,0:39:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I-- I won't,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.82,0:39:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说不出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.29,0:39:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我也害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.87,0:39:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.68,0:40:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我害怕恐怖分子会夺走我们的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid of terrorists who want what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.85,0:40:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要摧毁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to destroy us!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.27,0:40:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者更糟...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.67,0:40:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为其中一名恐怖分子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}because one of those terrorists...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.95,0:40:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我们当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}is one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.02,0:40:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle... 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的得力助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man I counted on,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.27,0:40:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信赖的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man I trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.50,0:40:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He led 'em here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.38,0:40:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他放他们进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he let 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.08,0:40:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谎话连篇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.79,0:40:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出卖了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}betrayed us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.48,0:41:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这名恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one of the terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.09,0:41:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是莫尔的亲兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle's own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家说我们该怎么处置他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what should we do with them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.90,0:41:33.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-杀了他们  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill them! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.71,0:41:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-该怎么办  -杀了他们 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you want? -  Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.91,0:41:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.76,0:42:01.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是想找你弟弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.28,0:42:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在满意了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you got him.